---
const defaults = { minus: -98.6, neutral: -100.0, plus: -99.3 };
---

<figure class="chapter-visual delta-scf-diagram" data-delta-scf>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>原创能量图：Delta-SCF 总能差 | Original energy diagram: Delta-SCF total-energy differences</strong>
    <span>输入三个独立自洽计算的总能，图中按定义计算电离能、电子亲和能与离散曲率。</span>
    <span lang="en">Enter total energies from three independent self-consistent calculations. The figure evaluates the ionization energy, electron affinity, and discrete curvature by definition.</span>
  </figcaption>

  <div class="chapter-visual__controls delta-scf-diagram__controls">
    <label><span>$E(N-1)$ (eV)</span><input data-minus type="number" step="0.1" value={defaults.minus} /></label>
    <label><span>$E(N)$ (eV)</span><input data-neutral type="number" step="0.1" value={defaults.neutral} /></label>
    <label><span>$E(N+1)$ (eV)</span><input data-plus type="number" step="0.1" value={defaults.plus} /></label>
  </div>

  <svg viewBox="0 0 760 330" role="img" aria-labelledby="delta-scf-title delta-scf-desc">
    <title id="delta-scf-title">Total-energy levels for N minus one, N, and N plus one electrons</title>
    <desc id="delta-scf-desc">Three horizontal energy levels and arrows defining ionization energy and electron affinity.</desc>
    <line class="energy-level" x1="80" y1="90" x2="260" y2="90" />
    <line class="energy-level neutral" x1="290" y1="245" x2="470" y2="245" />
    <line class="energy-level" x1="500" y1="165" x2="680" y2="165" />
    <text data-label-minus x="170" y="75" text-anchor="middle">E(N−1)=−98.6 eV</text>
    <text data-label-neutral x="380" y="275" text-anchor="middle">E(N)=−100.0 eV</text>
    <text data-label-plus x="590" y="150" text-anchor="middle">E(N+1)=−99.3 eV</text>
    <path d="M 290 235 Q 245 170 250 105" />
    <path d="M 470 235 Q 515 205 505 178" />
    <text data-label-i x="235" y="170" text-anchor="end">I=1.4 eV</text>
    <text data-label-a x="525" y="213">A=−0.7 eV</text>
  </svg>

  <p class="chapter-visual__readout" aria-live="polite">
    <span>$I=E(N-1)-E(N)=$ <strong data-i>1.400</strong> eV</span>
    <span>$A=E(N)-E(N+1)=$ <strong data-a>-0.700</strong> eV</span>
    <span>$U_{\mathrm{disc}}=E(N+1)+E(N-1)-2E(N)=$ <strong data-u>2.100</strong> eV</span>
  </p>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>验收：</strong>所有输出必须由显示的三个输入按定义复算；整体能量同时平移任意常数时，$I$、$A$ 与 $U_{disc}$ 不变。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Acceptance:</strong> every output must be reproducible from the three displayed inputs; adding the same constant to all energies leaves $I$, $A$, and $U_{disc}$ unchanged.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>输入若来自不同几何、不同泛函、不同边界条件或未收敛计算，所得差值没有统一物理含义。有限盒中的阴离子还需检查尾部和盒尺寸。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> the differences have no consistent meaning if the inputs use different geometries, functionals, boundary conditions, or unconverged calculations. Anions in finite boxes require separate tail and box-size checks.</p>
  </div>

  <noscript><p>无 JavaScript 时显示默认示例；定义仍可直接用于手工复算。</p></noscript>
</figure>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-delta-scf]').forEach((root) => {
    const inputs = ['minus', 'neutral', 'plus'].map((key) => root.querySelector(`[data-${key}]`));
    const update = () => {
      const [minus, neutral, plus] = inputs.map((input) => Number(input.value));
      const ionization = minus - neutral;
      const affinity = neutral - plus;
      const curvature = plus + minus - 2 * neutral;
      root.querySelector('[data-i]').textContent = ionization.toFixed(3);
      root.querySelector('[data-a]').textContent = affinity.toFixed(3);
      root.querySelector('[data-u]').textContent = curvature.toFixed(3);
      root.querySelector('[data-label-minus]').textContent = `E(N−1)=${minus.toFixed(1)} eV`;
      root.querySelector('[data-label-neutral]').textContent = `E(N)=${neutral.toFixed(1)} eV`;
      root.querySelector('[data-label-plus]').textContent = `E(N+1)=${plus.toFixed(1)} eV`;
      root.querySelector('[data-label-i]').textContent = `I=${ionization.toFixed(2)} eV`;
      root.querySelector('[data-label-a]').textContent = `A=${affinity.toFixed(2)} eV`;
    };
    inputs.forEach((input) => input.addEventListener('input', update));
    update();
  });
</script>

<style>
  .delta-scf-diagram__controls input {
    min-height: 2.25rem;
  }

  .delta-scf-diagram svg {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 17rem;
  }

  .delta-scf-diagram svg text {
    fill: currentColor;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .energy-level {
    stroke: var(--sl-color-accent-high);
    stroke-width: 4;
  }

  .energy-level.neutral {
    stroke-width: 6;
  }

  .delta-scf-diagram svg path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-dasharray: 5 4;
  }
</style>
